  "summary": "Three case studies that grow a web app step by step: a stateless site (Elastic IP, DNS, ELB, Auto Scaling, multi-AZ, reserved capacity), a stateful shop (sessions, ElastiCache, RDS replicas, security group chaining) and a WordPress site (Aurora, EBS versus EFS). Then fast instantiation with golden AMIs and snapshots, and AWS Elastic Beanstalk: components, platforms, web and worker tiers, environment types and deployments.",
